# M1 — Adapter and simulator: status

Updated: 2026-11-21 · App: Mieruka · Team: Zero-Ichi

## Current state

- Django app `m1` is registered in `config/settings.py` and routed at `/m1/`.
- `views.index` renders the shared placeholder through `kizuna.views.module_page()`.
- No adapter registry, simulator, scenario buttons, offline buffer, forms or feature tests yet.

